===Pronouns===
There are personal, demonstrative, interrogative and reflexive [[pronoun]]s, as well as an [[indefinite article]], which is plainly related to the numeral for "one."{{sfn|Waddell|de Lacouperie|1911|p=919}}

====Personal pronouns====
